      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A Material Variant is a child of another material. It takes every value from its parent, except the values it overrides. Here one concrete parent has three children: Clean overrides nothing, Dirty adds grime in its Detail Inputs, and Wet overrides Base Color (darker) and Smoothness (higher).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You make the parent's Base Color a little warmer (more orange). Which of the three panels change?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select the parent, M_Weather_Concrete, and change its Base Color.\n2. Select M_Weather_Concrete-Wet and find its overridden fields.\n3. Revert its Base Color override and look again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Materials-Training, 2 \xB7 Material Variants</color></size>"
