      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "An Occlusion Map darkens the crevices: the joints between the stones, where dirt also collects. A has the stones' Occlusion Map; B is the same material without it. The roof shades the top of both walls.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Where do A and B differ more: in the shade under the roof, or in the sunlit part below it?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select A's material, M_Surf_Occlusion-On.\n2. Move the Occlusion Map's strength between 0 and 1.\n3. Watch the shaded part and the sunlit part.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Texture-Maps, 1 \xB7 The Lit shader's texture maps</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
