  m_text: "The Detail Inputs' Base Map is a grey picture laid over the surface's colour: soot, dust, stains. The three panels use the same concrete and three different grey detail maps, without a mask. A's map is darker than mid-grey, B's is lighter, and C's is plain mid-grey (128).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> What does C's plain mid-grey detail map change on C?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Drag another detail map (T_Detail_Soot, T_Detail_Dust or T_Detail_Neutral-Grey) onto a panel's detail Base Map.\n2. Move the Scale next to it from 1 to 0, then to 2.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Texture-Maps, 4 \xB7 Colour and data</color></size>"
